    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1627">

                <pb facs="1183" n="1067" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1067"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.51/134.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Consul General
                        Hanna</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 11, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Henry Huguet, Frenchman of Santa Engracia, Tamaulipas, reported kidnapped August
                    4 and taken to Zaragoza by Captain Mucio Perez, under General Carrera Torres of
                    Tula, and that Huguet is being held pending payment $10,000 under penalty of
                    death in case non-payment.</p>
                <p>At request French Embassy, investigate, endeavor obtain Huguet’s release and
                    report.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Osborne.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
